<title>USA: SIOUX FALLS HOGS MIXED - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX FALLS HOGS MIXED - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were very uneven, ranging $0.50-0.75 lower to 1.00 higher. Trading moderately active.Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    near 700 hd 55.00-55.50</p>
<p>				 near 200 hd 57.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    54.50-55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.00-52.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.50-0.75 lower; 450-500 lbs 1.00 lower; 500-650 lbs steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.50-45.75</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    47.00-49.00</p>
</text>
